name=list
category=files
description=list directory contents
usage=list [-l|--long] [-t|--tree DEPTH] [path...]
option=-l, --long    show one entry per line with native metadata
option=-t DEPTH, --tree DEPTH    show a directory tree (maximum depth 16)
option=-h, --help    show this help
note=Multiple operands are listed in operand order; failures do not skip later operands, and any failure produces a nonzero status.
